[22:13:39] DOM-023 records that CostEvaluator still populates CostEvaluationResult.profitPerCraft and totalProfit using a pre-fee formula, while the planner independently computes profit with a different buy-cost basis. No production caller currently reads those fields. The stale fields remain misleading if reused.
